{"schemaVersion":1,"durationMinutes":30,"audioUrl":"","parts":[{"id":"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-p1","title":"Part 1","part_number":1,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3253486-succeed-in-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-1.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-g1-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 1-10","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p><p><strong>NOTES: travelling to France</strong></p><p><strong>Time of travel:</strong><em>September</em></p><p><strong>Advantages of travelling by train:</strong></p><p>• <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">1</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q1\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>• <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">2</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q2\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>• take as much <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">3</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q3\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> as you need</p><p><strong>The Eurostar:</strong></p><p>• runs on schedule <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">4</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q4\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> of the time</p><p>• can reach speeds of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">5</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q5\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> miles per hour</p><p><strong>Two options from Paris to Nice:</strong></p><p>1. Catch the TGV train at <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">6</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>2. Catch the TGV train at <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and travel <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Single tickets cost approximately <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> the return fare.</p><p>Flying from London to Nice takes <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/succeed-in-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3253485-succeed-in-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-2.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-succeed-ielts-t1-l-g2-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Qu